=== D. N^^fameros, unidades, dinero, fechas y siglos ===
[spnum-has-units]
! Package spintent Error: Units are not allowed in a numerical value ('5 m') on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spnum{5 m}$
Use '\spunit' to print numbers with units.
[spnum-no-digits]
! Package spintent Error: Invalid numerical value '' on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spnum{}$
A numerical value must contain at least one digit.
[spnum-no-digits-minus]
! Package spintent Error: Invalid numerical value '-' on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spnum{-}$
A numerical value must contain at least one digit.
[spunit-no-units]
! Package spintent Error: No unit found in '5' on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spunit{5}$
At least one unit is required; use '\spnum' for pure numbers.
[spunit-invalid-unit]
! Package spintent Error: Invalid unit expression '5 m/s/s' on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spunit{5 m/s/s}$
The expression contains an unknown or malformed unit. Check the spelling or verify that the unit is defined.
[spunit-invalid-unit-unknown]
! Package spintent Error: Invalid unit expression '5 xyz' on line ....
For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ...$\spunit{5 xyz}$
