For immediate help type H <return>.
 ...                                              
l. ......omb[kind=variation,print-sty=binom]{n,k}$
'circular' needs 'kind=permutation' and 'repeat=false'; 'print-sty=binom' needs 'kind=combination' and 'repeat=false'.
